# Export rules: unmatched commits are kept; 'keep' overrides exclusions.
#
#   drop-branch <name>   Exclude a topic branch.
#   drop <glob>          Exclude matching commit subjects.
#   keep <glob>          Retain matching commit subjects.
#
# This series is older than linux-pond's and is cut differently. It keeps only
# changes that linux-pond also keeps, or that are identical to mainline.

# Mac and T2 support.
drop-branch t2

# BBRv3.
drop-branch bbr3

# HDMI VRR and ALLM: an older series than the one linux-pond keeps; includes passive VRR.
drop-branch hdmi

# AES-GCM series: two commits differ from mainline and the others depend on them.
drop-branch crypto

# ROG Ally gamepad driver and ASUS changes that are not in mainline.
drop hid-asus-ally: *
drop ?NOT-FOR-UPSTREAM? hid-asus-ally: *
drop hid: add VID/PID for ASUS ROG RAIKIRI PRO
drop platform/x86: asus-wmi: change quiet to low-power
drop debug by default

# ADIOS I/O scheduler.
drop linux*-ADIOS-*
drop iosched-*: bump ADIOS to *
# Excluded in linux-pond.
drop Cachy: Use BFQ as the elevator for SQ devices

# VHBA virtual SCSI adapter (CDEmu).
drop CACHY: Add VHBA driver

# Intel remapped NVMe driver: added, reverted and added again.
drop *PCI: Add Intel remapped NVMe device support*

# GCC modulo scheduling: active here because this kernel is built with GCC.
# It changes generated code and reschedules no loops on x86-64.
drop Cachy: Add GCC SMS-based modulo scheduling
drop CACHY: Remove redundant -fmodulo-sched flag

# Not in linux-pond and not in mainline.
drop le9uo *
drop Cachy: mm: Disable unevictable compaction
drop Cachy: drm/amdgpu/pm: Allow override of min_power_limit*
drop locking: rwsem: spin faster
drop CACHY: Add config for default of unprivileged_userns_clone
drop Cachy: cpufreq: Remove schedutil dependency*
drop Cachy: Initialize ata before graphics
drop x86/CPU/AMD: Gatekeep Zen5 RDSEED*
drop hid-haptic: Fix building as a module

# Mainline changes in a form that differs from the mainline commit.
drop kbuild: move vmlinux.a build rule to scripts/Makefile.vmlinux_a
drop kbuild: distributed build support for Clang ThinLTO
drop x86/mm/tlb: Make enter_lazy_tlb() always inline on x86
drop sched: Make raw_spin_rq_unlock() inline
# Depends on the two inline changes above.
drop sched/core: Make finish_task_switch() and its subfunctions always inline

# Added and then reverted by CachyOS; exclude both sides.
drop *x86/bhi: Add BHB clearing for CPUs with larger branch history*
drop *x86/vmscape: *
drop *spi: cs42l43: Use actual ACPI firmware node for chip selects*

# Duplicate: stable's install-extmod-build has packaged the tool since 6.18.21
drop kbuild: add resolve_btfids to pacman PKGBUILD

# Duplicate: stable has carried the same three device entries since 6.18.19.
drop usb: core: add USB_QUIRK_NO_BOS for additional capture devices

# CachyOS release tooling; unused by Pond builds.
drop tag-release*
